{"id":"n21822-1-7","stage":2,"title":"건널목 · 平交道","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21822-1-7-1","ko":"빨리 건널목 건너가자.","zh":"我们快点过铁路道口吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"건널목","meaning":"平交道","explanation":"건널목：平交道。","readings":[{"term":"건널목","audio":"/audio/99e14d4cd9366ee4831c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21822","senseId":"1","lemma":"건널목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건널목","audio":"/audio/99e14d4cd9366ee4831c.mp3"}},{"text":"건너가자.","meaning":"过，跨过，渡过","explanation":"건너가다：过，跨过，渡过；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"건너가다","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60092","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건너가자","audio":"/audio/cbce19573c17b6e4b54f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"99e14d4cd9366ee4","term":"건널목","zh":"平交道","audio":"/audio/99e14d4cd9366ee4831c.mp3","entryId":"21822","definition":"在铁路和道路交叉的地方为了能让道路上的人可以穿越铁路而设置的地方。","pronunciation":["건ː널목"]},{"id":"b3d7025fea85beb2","term":"건너가다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3","entryId":"60092","definition":"从江河或桥、道路等的一边去另一边。","pronunciation":["건ː너가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/707731cd3038189c319d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21822-1-7-2","ko":"곧 기차 올 것 같으니까 조금 기다리자.","zh":"火车好像快来了，等一会儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将。","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"2